opic, and our mission is to ensure that the world safely makes the transition through transformative AI."},{"type":"changed","content":"Chris Olah, Jared Kaplan, and Holden Karnofsky made significant contributions to its content and development. More detailed contribution statement and acknowledgments below. <add>The preface and the acknowledgements are not part of the official constitution. </add>Overview Claude and the mission of Anthropic Claude is trained by Anthropic, and our mission is to ensure that the world safely makes the transition through transformative AI."}]}